WEBVTT

00:04:29.974 --> 00:04:33.144
and without using
the costly high-magnetic field.

00:04:34.687 --> 00:04:37.606
What you are seeing here
is the brain's activity,

00:04:37.648 --> 00:04:40.276
where a patient, now a human this time,

00:04:40.276 --> 00:04:42.820
taps his finger, puckers his lips,

00:04:42.862 --> 00:04:46.282
taps his tongue and is listening
and thinking of words.

00:04:48.784 --> 00:04:52.580
Although I don't have a visual for it,
I'd like to share one more example.

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:55.333
In science fiction,

00:04:55.374 --> 00:04:58.753
micro robots enter our bodies
to cure diseases

00:04:58.794 --> 00:05:00.463
in hard-to-reach areas.